        <mxCell id="tkpis" value="&lt;b&gt;To-Be impact targets (from ProcessMind analysis)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;- Estimated cycle time: 54 min → 37 min task time (-31%); calendar time dominated by waits: 5.1 d → &amp;lt; 1 d screening&lt;br&gt;- Automation rate: 38% → 46% of tasks (7 of 13 automated)&lt;br&gt;- Approvals run in parallel (AND gateway) on the same evidence set&lt;br&gt;- AI document validation removes the 29% resubmission loop&lt;br&gt;- Full audit trail in DMS; manual re-keying eliminated (direct ERP API)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2e7d32;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1000" width="760" height="120" as="geometry" />
